==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|T Promo|Dragonite|18}}, a {{TCG|T Promotional cards|T Promotional card}} only released in Japan.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Dragonite}}.
*'''Dragon Wave''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Lance's TM 01|128}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

